at provides UCaaS solutions, such as voice, video, text, specialized call handling, and desktop and mobile applications for small and medium-sized organizations. The company offers its products through direct channels, retailers, value-added resellers, technology services distributors, and other resellers, as well as online and sales representatives. Ooma, Inc. was incorporated in 2003 and is headquartered in Sunnyvale, California."}}